      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Edit a video file with Sana Streaming. Load Video feeds the first chain link, and the render streams the clip through the model. Each beat's prompt is an edit: the second beat changes it partway through the clip, on the frame where that beat starts.\n\nA Sana prompt is one edit: open with its verb, give two to four concrete details, and name what stays fixed; see the Sana Streaming prompt guide. Only the first beat's video is used. The clip is the jet ski render from this plugin's examples. Copy example_outputs/reactor_camera_beats.mp4 into ComfyUI's input folder first. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Edit a video file with Sana Streaming. Load Video feeds the first chain link, and the render streams the clip through the model. Each beat's prompt is an edit: the second beat changes it partway through the clip, on the frame where that beat starts.\n\nA Sana prompt is one edit: open with its verb, give two to four concrete details, and name what stays fixed; see the Sana Streaming prompt guide. Only the first beat's video is used. The clip is the jet ski render from this plugin's examples. Copy example_outputs/reactor_camera_beats.mp4 into ComfyUI's input folder first. Set your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
